  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blended Finance Platform for Resilient Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to establish the Credit Guarantee Vehicle to mobilize private capital for investment in resilient infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first phase of the MPA will establish a Credit Guarantee Vehicle as the first instrument of the Blended Finance Platform to mobilize private capital for investment in critical and resilient infrastructure such as the electricity, transport and logistics, and water and sanitation sector, to create jobs, reduce carbon emissions and deliver infrastructure services for citizens and businesses. Phase 1 of the MPA will consist of three parts namely: Part 1: CGV Capitalization: Provision of the Government Equity Participation to support the capitalization of the CGV and the issuance of CGV Credit Guarantees (including the establishment of the CGV and its management, staffing, governance, operational, monitoring and evaluation, financial management, procurement, environmental and social safeguards, and pipeline development arrangements, systems and procedures), Part 2: Pipeline Development: Provision of support for the development of a pipeline of potential projects for support under the CGV, including client engagement, the carrying out of risk assessments, pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, and legal, financing and operational structuring of projects and Part 3: Project Coordination and Implementation: Provision of support for the PIU and project management, including for financial management, procurement, environmental and social risk management, monitoring and evaluation, stakeholder engagement and coordination, and operational, administrative and compliance support for the establishment, operationalization and launch of the CGV.</narrative>
  </description>
